<component>
    <div v-flex="" class="case-pane doc-pane">
        <h2>{t("case.native_status_bar.title")}</h2>

        <Card title="组件说明">
            <p>NativeStatusBar 是 gpui-component 原生状态栏组件的 RML 封装。无 ElementId 构造（StatelessNoId），容器模式。</p>
            <p>子节点渲染在中央区域。通常用于 modern-window 的底部状态栏组合。</p>
        </Card>

        <Card title="基础用法">
            <p>包裹子元素作为状态栏内容。</p>
            <div style="border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 4px;">
                <NativeStatusBar>
                    <span>就绪</span>
                </NativeStatusBar>
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="动态状态(#[command] 事件)">
            <p>点击按钮切换状态栏消息(演示 #[command] 事件处理):</p>
            <div class="button-row">
                <Button label="就绪" primary="" on-click={on_show_ready} />
                <Button label="警告" warning="" on-click={on_show_warning} />
                <Button label="错误" danger="" on-click={on_show_error} />
            </div>
            <p>当前状态: {status_text}</p>
            <div style="border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 4px;">
                <NativeStatusBar>
                    <span>{status_text}</span>
                </NativeStatusBar>
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="API">
            <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
        </Card>
    </div>
</component>
